Authorship
----------

The full Git history of the upstream project is preserved in this repository.
All 137 commits up to and including the fork point are the work of the original
author and retain his authorship in the commit metadata. Commits after the fork
point are the work of this fork's maintainer unless their metadata says
otherwise.

To list them:

    git log --oneline 7ed13e2..HEAD          # changes made in this fork
    git log --oneline 7ed13e2                # original work


