Third-party components
----------------------

The pipeline builds on AequilibraE (https://www.aequilibrae.com/) and uses data
from OpenStreetMap (ODbL), the Czech Statistical Office (SLDB 2021), the Road
and Motorway Directorate (CSD 2025) and NDIC / Police ČR closure feeds. Each of
these carries its own licence and attribution requirements.

The `frontend/` submodule points at `analyticity/bp_ux_ui` and is governed by
that repository's terms.
